              <div class="brand-focus"><span class="brand-status-label">FOCUS ON:</span><p>Brand<br />Identity</p></div>
            </div>
            <section class="sidebar-explore" aria-label="Explore every dot of the world">
              <p class="explore-caption"><span>EXPLORE</span><span>EVERY DOT OF THE WORLD</span></p>
              <img src={base + "images/Every_Dot_animaton.gif"} alt="Animated blue dots exploring the world" />
            </section>
            <section class="bio">
              <h2 class="sidebar-title">BIO:</h2>
              <p>Multidisciplinary graphic designer focused on brand identity. Working both independently and as a part of a team, I use my creativity and love for aesthetics to evolve brands.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="design-habits">
              <h2 class="sidebar-title">DESIGN HABITS:</h2>
              <ul class="habit-list">
                <li>I know how to define the task and then figure out how to solve it.</li>
                <li>I start with context: market, audience, competitors, and environment.</li>
                <li>I own the process from research to final execution.</li>
              </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="inspiration">
              <h2>INSPIRATION<br />SOURCES:</h2>
              <ul><li>Urban &amp; nature hiking</li><li>Cooking</li><li>Crafting</li><li class="inspiration-dexter">My dog Dexter</li></ul>
            </section>
            <section class="values">
              <h2 class="sidebar-title">VALUES:</h2>
              <ul><li>[Ethical collaboration with people, teams, world]</li><li>[Clarity and respect in communication]</li><li>[Care and attention to details]</li></ul>
            </section>
            <section class="what-i-do" id="skills" aria-label="What I do">
              <h2 class="sidebar-title">WHAT I DO</h2>
